        "configuration_root_row": "| `configuration_root` | `<user-temp>\\pcv-hyperv-api-smoke\\pcv-spike-api-e157b200` |",
        "final_arp_row": "| ARP `PureCVisor Desktop Node` | `{C948BEA2-65D7-4047-81F3-FF4830E4BFC3}` `0.43.0` (1개) |",
        "final_hash_row": "| 설치본 Host / CLI SHA-256 | gate build와 같음 (`5f0b34a3…` / `9b8d20cf…`) |",
